<pre>
location ~ /docs/([^/]*/[^/]*)? {
    proxy_pass https://bucket.s3.amazonaws.com/docs-website/$1.html;
}
</pre>

Because regular expressions allow newlines by default it's possible to prepare a request that will force the application to generate a request vulnerable

